{"id":"637107","name":"香芋西米露","author":"风风野猪","authorId":"9329235","desc":"","cover":"images/637107/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香芋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"西米露","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香芋削皮(这是我自己种的)。","img":"images/637107/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净，切块。","img":"images/637107/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入沙锅。","img":"images/637107/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加西米露(要加多少，根据自己的想法)。","img":"images/637107/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加冰糖。","img":"images/637107/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加开水，一定要开水。","img":"images/637107/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮十五分钟。","img":"images/637107/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加盖闷二十分钟。","img":"images/637107/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"二十分钟后加椰奶。","img":"images/637107/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"当然，可以加其他的，或是纯牛奶。","img":"images/637107/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"一碗超香的香芋西米露就完成了。","img":"images/637107/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}